{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TrustPinValidationListener"},{"text":" : AnyObject, ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","text":"Sendable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When TrustPin detects a pin mismatch — potentially an active"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"machine-in-the-middle — the connection fails, but without a listener","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"neither the app nor its backend ever learns a MITM was detected in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"field. The listener is that observability hook: field telemetry for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"suspected MITM events, and rollout monitoring (success\/failure ratios per"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"domain before tightening policy).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Observe-only, by construction","anchor":"Observe-only-by-construction","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The listener is invoked strictly "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"after","type":"text"}]},{"text":" the verdict is decided. It has no","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"return value and cannot veto, approve, or alter a connection — hooking or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"replacing it can at most blind telemetry, never weaken pinning.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Contract","anchor":"Contract","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/cloud.trustpin.swift\/documentation\/TrustPinKit\/TrustPinValidationListener\/onValidationFailure(instanceId:domain:error:presen